    "preamble": "Rauf Ansari And Ors vs The State Of Jharkhand on 4 January, 2018 Author: Ananda Sen Bench: Ananda Sen In The High Court Of Jharkhand At Ranchi A.B.A. No. 6352 of 2017 1. Rauf Ansari 2. Ishrafil Rai @ Md. Israfil 3. Nazir Mian 4. Munna Ansari @ Munna Mian 5. Amin Ansari ..... Petitioner (s) V e r s u s The State of Jharkhand ..... Opposite Part With A.B.A. No. 6503 of 2017 1. Akhtar Ansari 2. Mahboob Alam ..... Petitioner (s) V e r s u s The State of Jharkhand ..... Opposite Part ..... Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Ananda Sen ..... For the Petitioner(s) : Mr.Dr. Hasnain Waris, Advocate ( in A.B.A. No. 6352 of 2 Mr. Indrajit Sinha (in A.B.A. No. 6503 of 2017)",
